  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-2abf073000797a0084837438",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "在 I 型系统中确定 K_v 值的最简便方法是读取低频渐近线在 ω=1 rad/sec 处的幅值，因为该渐近线为 A(ω)=K_v/ω。或者，读取低频渐近线上任一频率处的幅值并计算 K_v = ω A(ω)。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The easiest way of determining the value of K_v in a Type 1 system is to read the magnitude of the low-frequency asymptote at ω=1 rad/sec, because this asymptote is A(ω)=K_v/ω. Alternatively, read the magnitude at any frequency on the low-frequency asymptote and compute K_v = ω A(ω).",
